": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FUqxCuvNwoYQ7kNvwGjpzFO&_nc_oc=AdoQhqBLmmXEcUANGUj6aHGgtcnBsZh0h5hFoy25fk7u-iaH0L9-E1FQW9mf0NLcj9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP7im3JflC39LRcXBYQRozKYxdsHZNBf8YN4xdBVPH5-w&oe=6AC2799B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hwFugy2te2IQ7kNvwHq0e5T&_nc_oc=Adqwb8PsmVHJXwajMgDWLcEb9YPbzaFj1aPaMHHT0sBH763DwLZYPUUEg_XtMc58Pf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPFWys3KhzQAjVptu3Xs3iaS7cL3XLm4u-GiCzNruuD9A&oe=6AC269E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EaDTVx1iZAUQ7kNvwHWStlH&_nc_oc=AdpsF3I-oLT-2CFUxwxam0Fv8N6Fi47Z2VJjasr_6bXyzV92S0V4sEIhz3wURbgXhUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSNPn41Ww5g9kg-Hd4j8s1_iEukTF8YSUav3L0x204Hw&oe=6AC256AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=reSUH78YLnAQ7kNvwHz0jX0&_nc_oc=AdoTYny2u7KDpTVXI8e3BOK9v6jjaN5JMassfRwuryxT3qXXhwc6ArachS1atZxSCKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPEA-QpQ1l9IWDGP2BO2BLCv9RJphYKuJd7ZioY3ImI9Q&oe=6AC25652"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2PhGsZcRxCIQ7kNvwG5ESrh&_nc_oc=Adqzh4Gseg2SdRp0V4NKvohih5kNXAHiMrBV3WQPSLx8bmJdDbeKJj8qBCHEx2aCGXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPb8D9PZiDF_qfjo1sLp5HbRkrw5z5cDEW8Paccqns3Xw&oe=6AC25FFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a